{
  "task": {
    "id": "Prob057_kmap2",
    "spec": "\r\nI would like you to implement a module named TopModule with the following\r\ninterface. All input and output ports are one bit unless otherwise\r\nspecified.\r\n\r\n - input  a\r\n - input  b\r\n - input  c\r\n - input  d\r\n - output out\r\n\r\nThe module should implement the circuit described by the Karnaugh map\r\nbelow.\r\n\r\n              ab\r\n   cd   00  01  11  10\r\n   00 | 1 | 1 | 0 | 1 |\r\n   01 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 1 |\r\n   11 | 0 | 1 | 1 | 1 |\r\n   10 | 1 | 1 | 0 | 0 |\r\n\r\n",
    "interface": {
      "top": "TopModule",
      "ports": [
        {
          "name": "a",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "b",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "c",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "d",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "out",
          "direction": "output",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "constraints": "SystemVerilog, exactly one self-contained TopModule DUT. Inline all helper logic inside TopModule; do not define auxiliary modules. xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns synthesis clock; simulator seed 1. No reference dependencies, hierarchy outside the DUT, file access, includes or DPI."
  },
  "sample_id": "ef87f122-6c35-4bca-9c1a-cd5c4f5a062e",
  "variant_id": "C",
  "current": {
    "revision_id": "53413f34-7137-46b6-8d5a-b91b694af390",
    "source_sha256": "e2ff5f4497ea35c206342938f0f13823055fc0b9f86e02556ca9bf59a912ac40",
    "source": "\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  a,\n    input  b,\n    input  c,\n    input  d,\n    output out\n);\n\n    assign out = (~b & ~c) | (~a & ~d) | (b & c & d) | (a & c & d) | (a & b & d);\n\nendmodule\n"
  },
